     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\"><div>Hello,<br><br></div>I have an error and i can&#39;t succeed to deal with it.<br><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\">The command is (all are ordered factors)<br><br>modele &lt;- &quot;<br>f1 =~ `q30[1]` + `q30[2]` + `q30[3]` + `q30[4]`<br>f2 =~ `q30[8]` + `q30[9]` + `q30[10]` + `q30[13]` + `q32[5]`<br>f3 =~ `q30[5]` + `q30[6]` + `q30[7]` + `q30[11]` + `q30[15]` + `q30[17]` + `q32[3]` + `q32[3]`<br>f4 =~ `q30[10]` + `q30[14]`<br>f5 =~ `q30[12]` + `q30[16]` + `q32[1]` + `q32[6]`<br>&quot;<br>lavaan:cfa(model=modele,data=profs3)<br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\"><br></div><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;display:inline!important;float:none;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">The error message is :</span><br style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\"><br style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\"><pre style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;outline:none medium;border:medium none;margin:0px;line-height:15px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Error in tmp[cbind(REP$row[idx], REP$col[idx])] &lt;- lavpartable$free[idx] : \r\n  NAs are not allowed in subscripted assignments\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">In addition: </span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Warning messages:\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">1: </span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">In pc_cor_TS(fit.y1 = FIT[[i]], fit.y2 = FIT[[j]], method = optim.method,  :</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">\r\n </span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"> lavaan WARNING: empty cell(s) in bivariate table of q30[7] x q30[8]\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">2: </span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">In pc_cor_TS(fit.y1 = FIT[[i]], fit.y2 = FIT[[j]], method = optim.method,  :</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">\r\n </span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"> lavaan WARNING: empty cell(s) in bivariate table of q30[12] x q30[13]\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">3: </span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">In pc_cor_TS(fit.y1 = FIT[[i]], fit.y2 = FIT[[j]], method = optim.method,  :</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">\r\n </span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"> lavaan WARNING: empty cell(s) in bivariate table of q30[14] x q30[11]\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">4: </span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">In lavpartable$group == g &amp; REP$mat == mmNames[mm] :</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">\r\n </span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"> longer object length is not a multiple of shorter object length<br></span></pre><pre style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;outline:none medium;border:medium none;margin:0px;line-height:15px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br>And when I use version on github I have a different error :<br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Error in lav_model(lavpartable = lavpartable, representation = lavoptions$representation,  : \r\n  lavaan ERROR: parameter is not defined: q30[1] | t2\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">In addition: </span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Warning messages:\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">1: </span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">In pc_cor_TS(fit.y1 = FIT[[i]], fit.y2 = FIT[[j]], method = optim.method,  :</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">\r\n </span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"> lavaan WARNING: empty cell(s) in bivariate table of q30[7] x q30[8]\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">2: </span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">In pc_cor_TS(fit.y1 = FIT[[i]], fit.y2 = FIT[[j]], method = optim.method,  :</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">\r\n </span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"> lavaan WARNING: empty cell(s) in bivariate table of q30[12] x q30[13]\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">3: </span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">In pc_cor_TS(fit.y1 = FIT[[i]], fit.y2 = FIT[[j]], method = optim.method,  :</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">\r\n </span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"> lavaan WARNING: empty cell(s) in bivariate table of q30[14] x q30[11]</span><br><br>If anybody have an idea